            "notes": "## TIP\n[Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) has a strong synergy with [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68) allowing us to have at least double the Kitsune during the round. Indeed, the damage over time of [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) is considered a **negative effect**. So every time you cleanse yourself, you gain the 5% ult charge of the power.\n\n## CORE\n- [Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b) \n- [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8)\n- [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) or [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) \n- [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e)\n\n## RECOMMENDED\n- [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56)\n- [Eye of the Yokai](item_60d1abaa-e0df-4911-b190-b663cfa3e0c7)\n- [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)",
